# PWA spinal-cord routing — env template for PACT-20260424-001 Option B.
#
# When activated, all PWA API calls route through the admin gateway
# (/api/customer/* -> Next.js rewrite -> admin /api/rc/* -> RC /api/v1/*)
# instead of direct to RC port 8080.
#
# To activate, copy to .env.production.local (or .env.venue.local via build
# pipeline) and rebuild the PWA standalone image.
#
# Rollback: restore .env.production.local values to direct-RC strings
# (NEXT_PUBLIC_API_URL=http://192.168.31.23:8080) and rebuild.
#
# ------------------------------------------------------------
# VENUE (Server .23)
# ------------------------------------------------------------
# NEXT_PUBLIC_API_URL=/api/customer
# NEXT_PUBLIC_WS_URL=ws://192.168.31.23:8080/ws/dashboard
# NEXT_PUBLIC_WS_TOKEN=rp-terminal-2026
# NEXT_PUBLIC_IS_CLOUD=false
# ADMIN_GATEWAY_URL=http://192.168.31.23:3201
#
# ------------------------------------------------------------
# CLOUD (Bono VPS) — depends on PACT-20260424-004 landing first
# ------------------------------------------------------------
# NEXT_PUBLIC_API_URL=/api/customer
# NEXT_PUBLIC_WS_URL=wss://api.racingpoint.cloud/ws/dashboard
# NEXT_PUBLIC_WS_TOKEN=<cloud-ws-token>
# NEXT_PUBLIC_IS_CLOUD=true
# ADMIN_GATEWAY_URL=https://admin.racingpoint.cloud
#
# ------------------------------------------------------------
# Toggles
# ------------------------------------------------------------
# NEXT_PUBLIC_API_URL semantics:
#   /api/customer           -> spinal-cord routing (via admin gateway rewrite)
#   http://host:8080        -> legacy direct-to-RC (pre-B-001)
#   (anything else)         -> fetch() calls that URL literally; will break
#                              unless the endpoint has RC-compatible /api/v1 paths
#
# ADMIN_GATEWAY_URL semantics (server-side, used by next.config.ts rewrites):
#   Must resolve from the Next.js server's perspective, NOT the browser.
#   The browser only ever sees /api/customer/* (same-origin).
#
# WebSocket (NEXT_PUBLIC_WS_URL):
#   Not proxied through admin gateway. A4 exempt per gateway contract —
#   direct to RC :8080 permanently. PWA/kiosk real-time channels bypass
#   spinal cord by design (latency + streaming constraints).
